5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I worry about social friction. We need to know how current arrangements affect neighborly relations.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m curious if the current spots match where people actually park. It feels unfair to some.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning rush is chaotic. I want to understand the physical layout and usage patterns better.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Nobody checks the costs. I need to see the actual financial burden on the building and residents.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Who maintains this? I want to know the ongoing administrative and physical effort required.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, if we charge, will people stop coming to meetings? I’ve heard that happen elsewhere.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, do you think the rain is a big factor? Some spots get soaked.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, yes, wet saddles are a daily annoyance. I’ll look into the exposure.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, that’s a valid concern. I’ll check the ledger and the station park costs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I’ll look at the treasurer’s file and the complaint log to gauge the workload.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll check the minutes and the neighboring block’s account to see historical patterns.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll look at the sticker register and the morning departures to see who rides when.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll examine the rain exposure and the morning departures to map the chaos.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll review the two-year ledger and the ward cycle park fees for comparison.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the treasurer’s handover file and the supplier’s display frame trial.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let’s see what the data says before we argue.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Agreed. Facts first, feelings later.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll be back with observations on the physical flow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll bring the numbers.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll bring the maintenance reality.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
