60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option B avoids the payment friction I saw in the neighbor’s block. It’s the safest for social harmony.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option A aligns with the daily riders’ preference to pay. It’s fairer than a pure lottery.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option C solves the shifting, but the greasing and slow loading are deal-breakers for me.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A is the only one that generates income to cover the maintenance. We need the money.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A is risky due to the maintenance burden. Option B is low effort but ignores the rain.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the income is good, but the social cost is high. I vote B.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, the social cost is manageable if we communicate well. I vote A.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, the rain is a major issue. A lottery doesn’t fix that. I vote A, hoping for better placement.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the rain is a placement issue, not a system issue. I vote A.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the maintenance is the problem. I vote B to minimize the burden.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I stand by B. It’s the least likely to cause conflict.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I stand by A. It’s the most fair for those who use it most.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I stand by A. It’s the most practical for the morning rush.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I stand by A. It’s the only sustainable financial model.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I stand by B. It’s the most sustainable operationally.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Let’s vote.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"Yes, let’s decide.","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
